  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Pablo Escobar's hippos are still alive.",
      "scene": 0,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And Colombia has approved killing more than eighty of them.",
      "scene": 1,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To understand why, you have to go back to 1981.",
      "scene": 2,
      "claim_ids": [],
      "allow_no_claim": true,
      "editorial": "turn to context, not a factual claim"
    },
    {
      "text": "Escobar imports four hippos for his private zoo.",
      "scene": 3,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His estate sits between Medellín and Bogotá.",
      "scene": 4,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In 1993 he dies, and the hippos escape.",
      "scene": 5,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By 2007, there are sixteen.",
      "scene": 6,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By 2014, about forty.",
      "scene": 7,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, around two hundred.",
      "scene": 8,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But most conservationists call them invasive.",
      "scene": 9,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So in April 2026, Colombia approves killing over eighty.",
      "scene": 10,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "An Indian billionaire offers to take them to India instead.",
      "scene": 11,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But some ecologists say they should stay.",
      "scene": 12,
      "claim_ids": [
        "H10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Escobar is gone, but his hippos are not.",
      "scene": 13,
